Tests multi-tenant inference, regional residency, streaming features, and monitoring in a production-ready path.

## Key Concepts
- Multi-tenant inference isolation
- SageMaker PrivateLink and regional data lakes
- Feature Store integration with streaming data
- Drift detection and Model Monitor

